{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/photo/bkn-20261110123057088-1110_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261110163908\"/><p>單位冒出火光。</p><p>藍田發生火警。今午(10日)12時22分，滙景花園15座一單位失火冒煙，街坊見狀紛紛報案。</p><p>消防接報趕至後，隨即開喉射水灌救，約16分鐘後火撲滅，起火單車被濃煙熏黑。消防經初步調查後，相信猛烈的陽光經折射後，睡房內有易燃物被點着釀成火警。事件中，約50人自行疏散到安全地方暫避，無人受傷，起火原因沒有可疑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.502921+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T04:30:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:36:19.787590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:03.690153+00:00","content_hash":"e6ba46934b0a42780ff36aa1655f44cc1ae9f2d8195dc86363447e85ebc68a86","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}